WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.509
Speaker 1: Joe Biden today is going to be
making some of the biggest foreign policy

00:00:03.509 --> 00:00:07.920
news really in a long time as far as the United
States is concerned.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:15.459
Joe Biden will be withdrawing all U.S. troops
from Afghanistan starting very soon and to

00:00:15.459 --> 00:00:18.670
be completed by September 11th of this year.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:26.470
The Washington Post can now report that will
be 20 years to the day since the 9/11 2001

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.470
attacks.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:34.930
Joe Biden, who we were told by Donald Trump
and even by some on the left would start wars,

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:40.870
was some kind of bloodthirsty warmonger, would
never bring troops home, would send more troops

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.550
to more places.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:50.390
Joe Biden is going to do what George W. Bush,
Barack Obama and Donald Trump could not do

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:52.249
or at least did not do.

00:00:52.249 --> 00:00:56.649
Now, I know that some of you will be saying,
well, hold on a second, it was going to happen

00:00:56.649 --> 00:00:58.469
May 1st.

00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:00.219
Now it's going to be September 11.

00:01:00.219 --> 00:01:01.219
That's that's a delay.

00:01:01.219 --> 00:01:02.550
What's going on?

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.170
Remember the back story of that?

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:10.990
The Trump administration negotiated a May
1st deadline with the Taliban last year when

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:15.590
Joe Biden came into office, he did something
that I think is generally smart.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:21.500
He came in and said he didn't say because
the Trump administration was so incompetent

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.500
in every way.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.200
But Joe Biden came in and said, I'm going
to review all ongoing projects and their associated

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.500
timelines and dates.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:33.210
I'm pausing and reviewing before committing
to either doing the thing Donald Trump started

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.930
to do or not.

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:38.450
This included pausing and evaluating the May
1st plan.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:45.060
There were things about the May 1st plan that
were real question marks, including how exactly

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:46.570
would the withdrawal be done?

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:50.960
Who has been coordinated with in terms of
this withdrawal?

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:57.670
And the sort of cynical interpretation from
some was Biden is pausing the May 1st withdrawal

00:01:57.670 --> 00:01:59.710
because he doesn't really want to leave.

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.230
He wants to stay forever.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:05.640
He may even send more troops in this particular
case.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.070
And we evaluate other cases on their merits.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:13.980
In this particular case, it appears that Joe
Biden really was just skeptical that Donald

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:18.489
Trump did anything right and he wanted to
evaluate this plan for himself.

00:02:18.489 --> 00:02:19.489
As a result.

00:02:19.489 --> 00:02:21.709
It won't be May, but it's going to be September.

00:02:21.709 --> 00:02:23.750
It will take four extra months.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.629
I'd rather Biden do it competently.

00:02:26.629 --> 00:02:34.200
And have it take four more months than simply
do it the way Trump planned, likely incompetently,

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:37.010
much like everything else that Donald Trump
did.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.010
Now in terms of numbers.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:42.019
Officially, there are 2500 U.S. troops left
in Afghanistan.

00:02:42.019 --> 00:02:44.749
The real number is more like 3500.

00:02:44.749 --> 00:02:49.780
There are also 7000 foreign forces, mostly
NATO troops.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:54.390
We don't know exactly what happens with those
other troops at this point in time.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:58.080
But Joe Biden will be holding a public event
today.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.580
It may have already happened by the time you
listen to today's show or watch this clip

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.299
where maybe he will outline that.

00:03:04.299 --> 00:03:11.079
Importantly, Joe Biden's plan for withdrawal
from Afghanistan is not conditions based.

00:03:11.079 --> 00:03:13.400
We are simply getting out.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:18.670
And a senior administration official said
to The Washington Post that a conditions based

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:24.799
plan would be a, quote, recipe for staying
forever in Afghanistan.

00:03:24.799 --> 00:03:26.430
That would be very bad.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:32.749
The U.S. is going to draw down to zero by
September 11th, regardless of conditions.

00:03:32.749 --> 00:03:41.569
Now, we've previously said or asked the question,
how far does American responsibility go in

00:03:41.569 --> 00:03:50.219
places where we enter and things break, the
U.S. military goes in, things break, and then

00:03:50.219 --> 00:03:55.099
we are responsible, at least to some degree,
you break it, you bought it is sort of the

00:03:55.099 --> 00:03:56.099
general idea.

00:03:56.099 --> 00:04:00.659
How long do you have to stay until you can
say, well, we now we are getting out, even

00:04:00.659 --> 00:04:02.480
if it's not totally fixed.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:07.559
There's very varied opinions about this and
much validity in different ways.

00:04:07.559 --> 00:04:12.730
Joe Biden has made a decision that the limit
is September 11th, 2001.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.620
Of course, we will believe it if and when
it happens.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:20.900
But this has been trillions of dollars, hundreds
of thousands dead, millions certainly affected

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:21.900
by it.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.660
It is time to go.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:28.040
Trump promised that he couldn't get it done
during his presidency.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.099
Biden is at least apparently going to do it
now.

00:04:31.099 --> 00:04:33.050
What will the Trump supporters say?

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:37.759
They seemed to support it when it was Donald
Trump who announced that this is what he was

00:04:37.759 --> 00:04:39.110
going to be doing.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.759
They should still support it.

00:04:40.759 --> 00:04:46.389
I can't imagine they would now be rooting,
I don't know, for the Taliban or for whoever

00:04:46.389 --> 00:04:50.780
if they supported it happening when it was
Trump that announced that you would imagine

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:54.840
if they were consistent, they would support
it now as well.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:58.069
Some are already saying that September 11th
is too soon, though.

00:04:58.069 --> 00:05:02.379
Now, how does that make sense if May 1st was
OK?

00:05:02.379 --> 00:05:06.290
How does taking four extra months make it
too soon?

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:14.630
You'd have to ask them now some practical
questions will Afghanistan destabilize after

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.979
U.S. troops leave?

00:05:15.979 --> 00:05:17.169
We don't know.

00:05:17.169 --> 00:05:19.440
It's possible that that will happen.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:21.389
Will Iran get more involved?

00:05:21.389 --> 00:05:22.389
Maybe.

00:05:22.389 --> 00:05:27.009
In fact, Iran getting involved could be sort
of part of restructuring and getting back

00:05:27.009 --> 00:05:29.129
to the Iran nuclear deal.

00:05:29.129 --> 00:05:30.129
We don't know yet.

00:05:30.129 --> 00:05:31.610
That's another possibility.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:37.260
It's premature to assume that al-Qaida simply
rises again or that the Islamic State rises

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:38.379
again.

00:05:38.379 --> 00:05:41.500
The Taliban is very opposed to the Islamic
State.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.139
Al-Qaida has a little presence.

00:05:43.139 --> 00:05:48.289
Sure, al Qaeda could try to regroup in Afghanistan,
but there are easier places at this point

00:05:48.289 --> 00:05:50.449
for al-Qaida to try to regroup.

00:05:50.449 --> 00:05:53.300
So what we know for now is the date is September
11th.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.120
Twenty, twenty one.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:01.560
Let's see if the phase drawdown starts and
let's see if we are out in what is essentially

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.520
just under five months from today.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:19.050
But this is a good decision and it is a major
foreign 

00:06:19.050 --> 00:07:41.479
policy decision.

